# Default: normalize text files to LF in the repo. This line must come FIRST: when several lines
# match a path, the later line wins, so the machine-file rules below must follow it.
*       text=auto
# Machine files must keep their exact bytes/line endings (WinCNC programs and the Fusion post use CRLF).
*.cps   -text
*.tap   -text
*.tools binary
*.f3d   binary
*.f3dhsm-template binary
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
